humans stand alone in the animal kingdom  our power over nature is unparalleled  what separates us what is it that makes  us human  the answer lies in our mastery of  communication the power to express  complex thoughts and ideas to organize  and think collectively these are the  engines of our success driving our  ascent from hunter-gatherers to a global  civilization  communication is everywhere our  technology has propelled us to a new age  of interconnectedness waves of data pass  through us at the speed of light  [Applause]  music language art the written word  through these tools the boundless human  imagination has been given a voice they  give a self expression and collective  knowledge they have a dark side these  tools are so powerful that they distort  our very perception of reality they can  subvert and corrupt and even manipulate  entire population communication is what  makes us how did it emerge how did it  transform us to a creature that could  dream to a creature that could imagine  where millions could eventually learn to  cooperate to overcome to transcend this  is the story of how our world came to be  how communications defined our species  and created the modern age how connected  humanity and sense our voice and a  course for the star this is origin  [Music]
 

